@startuml
title 컴포넌트와 인터페이스 (SWA-001)

package "전자식 차일드락 SW" {
  component "C-CTL 제어기" as CTL
  component "C-VAL 입력 검증기" as VAL
  component "C-STA 상태 관리기" as STA
  component "C-ARB 판정기" as ARB
}

interface "IF-CTL" as ICTL
interface "IF-VAL" as IVAL
interface "IF-STA" as ISTA
interface "IF-ARB" as IARB

CTL - ICTL
VAL - IVAL
STA - ISTA
ARB - IARB

CTL ..> IVAL : 검증
CTL ..> ISTA : 상태
CTL ..> IARB : 결정

note bottom of CTL
  공유 데이터 타입: eclp_types.h (값 구조체만, 함수 없음)
  의존 방향은 C-CTL -> 나머지 한 방향
end note
@enduml
